  "details": "When playing with an xbox controller on desktop mode, I intermittently lose the ability to move while still being able to make gestures. I've never had this issue before. When I revert off the 1744 beta, the problem vanishes. Nothing else has changed in my setup except the change to the 1744 beta. I can still move with the keyboard, but controller movements stop working intermittently. The problem happens mainly when powering the controller off and back on again.",
